terrazarr started as a fork of eopf_geozarr.conversion.geozarr (the GeoZarr multiscale
writer of that package). The pipeline, the multiscale metadata layout and several function
names are theirs; the lazy, windowed, resumable rewrite for planetary-scale rasters, the
benchmark harness and the documentation are this project's. See docs/changes.md for the list of
changes against the original.
